All right, can I get another...

2296
01:57:46,940 --> 01:57:47,620
Ultimate potion!

2297
01:57:49,180 --> 01:57:50,100
I'll take it.

2298
01:57:50,100 --> 01:57:50,780
How many do you have?

2299
01:57:52,060 --> 01:57:54,260
I am the ultimatest of all the ultimates.

2300
01:58:00,280 --> 01:58:01,740
Man, this must smell in here.

2301
01:58:04,890 --> 01:58:05,810
Look at that face.

2302
01:58:06,570 --> 01:58:09,610
That's the face of someone who just earned 300 buckaroos.

2303
01:58:12,590 --> 01:58:13,310
I'll see you later.

2304
01:58:16,860 --> 01:58:20,780
So now I can actually collect money and have it do something for me.

2305
01:58:24,990 --> 01:58:26,090
Give me the hammer.

2306
01:58:27,970 --> 01:58:28,530
Oh.

2307
01:58:28,810 --> 01:58:29,250
Really?

2308
01:58:29,470 --> 01:58:29,750
Empty.

2309
01:58:30,650 --> 01:58:31,110
Okay.

2310
01:58:32,070 --> 01:58:34,070
Now, I have a feeling that...

2311
01:58:34,070 --> 01:58:37,370
The spider situation only changes when I get to 50.

2312
01:58:38,130 --> 01:58:39,430
48 may not do it.

2313
01:58:39,430 --> 01:58:40,410
That's a weird number, right?

2314
01:58:41,050 --> 01:58:41,410
So...

2315
01:58:41,410 --> 01:58:43,610
Unless 45 is a number, but...

2316
01:58:43,610 --> 01:58:44,050
Doubt it.

2317
01:58:44,510 --> 01:58:45,850
Wait, this is...

2318
01:58:46,910 --> 01:58:47,710
Wait, what do you sell?

2319
01:58:52,050 --> 01:58:52,410
Poe?

2320
01:58:53,610 --> 01:58:54,850
I mean, I don't want...

2321
01:58:54,850 --> 01:58:55,310
What's that?

2322
01:58:55,670 --> 01:58:56,610
No, I don't want that.

2323
01:58:57,990 --> 01:58:58,350
Ooh!

2324
01:59:01,870 --> 01:59:03,350
Oh, I actually kind of want that.

2325
01:59:05,730 --> 01:59:06,150
Oh, no.

2326
01:59:06,230 --> 01:59:07,290
Ultimate potion is better, right?

2327
01:59:07,290 --> 01:59:07,890
It costs 100.

2328
01:59:09,410 --> 01:59:10,650
It's got to be better than all of that.

2329
01:59:12,030 --> 01:59:12,590
Yeah.

2330
01:59:12,930 --> 01:59:13,790
For sure.

2331
01:59:15,110 --> 01:59:16,350
Remind me what was in here.

2332
01:59:18,270 --> 01:59:19,030
This guy.

2333
01:59:20,250 --> 01:59:21,830
Maybe I'll restock on some things.

2334
01:59:22,630 --> 01:59:23,950
Feels good to spend some money.

2335
01:59:25,170 --> 01:59:26,390
Arrows I have enough of.

2336
01:59:26,950 --> 01:59:27,970
Bombs I don't.

2337
01:59:29,470 --> 01:59:30,410
I'll take...

2338
01:59:30,410 --> 01:59:30,650
Yeah.

2339
01:59:31,570 --> 01:59:32,130
Thanks.

2340
01:59:32,610 --> 01:59:33,130
One more.

2341
01:59:34,950 --> 01:59:35,510
Dankeschön.

2342
01:59:36,310 --> 01:59:37,410
See you later, bro.

2343
01:59:41,760 --> 01:59:42,980
What about this guy up here?

2344
01:59:48,250 --> 01:59:49,430
Can you see it from there?

2345
01:59:49,810 --> 01:59:51,190
Death Mountain is back to normal.

2346
01:59:51,830 --> 01:59:52,510
I know.

2347
01:59:52,730 --> 01:59:53,510
I did it.

2348
01:59:53,690 --> 01:59:54,030
Me.

2349
01:59:54,210 --> 01:59:54,450
Link.

2350
01:59:55,570 --> 01:59:57,190
The hero of the hour.

2351
02:00:01,150 --> 02:00:01,590
Okay.

2352
02:00:02,290 --> 02:00:05,930
I want to unequip that potion because I can accidentally drink that.

2353
02:00:06,090 --> 02:00:06,990
I can just see it right now.

2354
02:00:08,390 --> 02:00:10,090
Let's not do that.

2355
02:00:12,430 --> 02:00:12,870
Okay.

2356
02:00:12,970 --> 02:00:14,310
Do we just go straight away?

2357
02:00:15,930 --> 02:00:16,830
Let me look at the map.

2358
02:00:19,750 --> 02:00:21,830
Why is the blinking in the...

2359
02:00:21,830 --> 02:00:22,730
In the spot?

2360
02:00:24,290 --> 02:00:26,510
I don't understand this blinkerino.

2361
02:00:29,900 --> 02:00:30,680
Don't get it.

2362
02:00:32,880 --> 02:00:34,580
Let's teleport to the Temple of Time.

2363
02:00:37,020 --> 02:00:37,900
Song of Time.

2364
02:00:38,200 --> 02:00:38,480
No.

2365
02:00:38,560 --> 02:00:39,240
Prelude of Light.

2366
02:00:40,100 --> 02:00:40,800
Up, right, up.

2367
02:00:41,600 --> 02:00:42,080
Right.

2368
02:00:42,360 --> 02:00:43,060
Left, up.

2369
02:00:43,740 --> 02:00:44,660
Up, right, up.

2370
02:00:44,800 --> 02:00:45,380
Right, left, up.

2371
02:00:51,300 --> 02:00:51,940
Left, right, up.

2372
02:00:51,940 --> 02:00:52,380
Let's see if I remember.

2373
02:00:52,980 --> 02:00:54,520
Up, right, up.

2374
02:00:54,860 --> 02:00:55,640
Left, left.

2375
02:00:56,100 --> 02:00:56,860
There we go.

2376
02:00:57,160 --> 02:00:57,640
I got it.

2377
02:01:11,420 --> 02:01:13,280
I've been waiting for you, Link!

2378
02:01:14,600 --> 02:01:15,240
Wait.

2379
02:01:15,840 --> 02:01:16,480
Where?

2380
02:01:16,660 --> 02:01:16,880
Who?

2381
02:01:19,760 --> 02:01:20,400
You!

2382
02:01:22,500 --> 02:01:23,140
Link!

2383
02:01:23,380 --> 02:01:25,120
The hero of time.

2384
02:01:26,760 --> 02:01:30,260
You have overcome many hardships and awakened six sages.

2385
02:01:31,380 --> 02:01:32,920
Excuse me, who are you?

2386
02:01:33,920 --> 02:01:35,940
And now you have a final challenge.

2387
02:01:35,940 --> 02:01:37,600
A showdown with Ganondorf.

2388
02:01:37,980 --> 02:01:39,340
The king of evil.

2389
02:01:40,780 --> 02:01:41,980
You sure know a lot.

2390
02:01:44,380 --> 02:01:48,440
Before that, I have things I want to tell only to you.

2391
02:01:49,280 --> 02:01:50,320
Please listen.

2392
02:01:51,800 --> 02:01:56,620
Another unknown legend of the Triforce passed down by the Shadow Folk.

2393
02:01:56,840 --> 02:01:57,800
The Sheikas.

2394
02:01:58,820 --> 02:01:59,340
Oh yeah?

2395
02:02:07,310 --> 02:02:11,090
If you would seek the Sacred Triangle, listen well.

2396
02:02:12,570 --> 02:02:19,030
The resting place of the Sacred Triangle, the Sacred Realm, is a mirror that reflects what is in the heart.

2397
02:02:21,650 --> 02:02:23,390
The heart of one who enters it.

2398
02:02:23,710 --> 02:02:26,450
If an evil heart, the realm will become full of evil.

2399
02:02:26,910 --> 02:02:29,250
If pure, the realm will become a paradise.

2400
02:02:29,750 --> 02:02:31,730
So if I enter, there's potatoes everywhere?

2401
02:02:33,490 --> 02:02:35,750
The Triforce, the Sacred Triangle.

2402
02:02:36,090 --> 02:02:38,410
It is a balance that weighs the three...

2403
02:02:38,410 --> 02:02:39,290
not three forces.

2404
02:02:39,850 --> 02:02:41,390
Power, wisdom, and courage.

2405
02:02:42,890 --> 02:02:43,410
Okay.

2406
02:02:43,910 --> 02:02:52,530
If the heart of the one who holds the Sacred Triangle has all three forces in balance, that one will gain the true force to govern all.

2407
02:02:53,330 --> 02:02:55,570
Oh my god, I'm gonna be a ruler of the universe.

2408
02:02:56,590 --> 02:03:01,550
But if that one's heart is not in balance, the Triforce will separate into three parts.

2409
02:03:02,190 --> 02:03:03,430
Power, wisdom, and courage.

2410
02:03:04,770 --> 02:03:08,190
Only one part will remain for the one who touched the Triforce.

2411
02:03:08,610 --> 02:03:11,750
The part representing the force that one most believes in.

2412
02:03:13,150 --> 02:03:13,710
Right.

2413
02:03:16,190 --> 02:03:21,010
If that one seeks the true force, that one must acquire the two lost parts.

2414
02:03:23,390 --> 02:03:31,050
Those two parts will be held within others chosen by destiny, who will bear the Triforce mark on the backs of their hands.

2415
02:03:33,050 --> 02:03:33,690
Really?

2416
02:03:35,710 --> 02:03:38,590
Like a tattoo, or...?

2417
02:03:41,110 --> 02:03:49,230
Seven years ago, Ganondorf, the King of Thieves, used the door you opened in the Temple of Time and entered the Sacred Realm.

2418
02:03:50,550 --> 02:03:54,870
But when he laid his hands on the Triforce, the legend came true.

2419
02:03:57,330 --> 02:04:00,150
The Triforce separated into three parts.

2420
02:04:00,750 --> 02:04:04,130
Only the Triforce of Power remained in Ganondorf's hand.

2421
02:04:07,480 --> 02:04:11,840
The strength of the Triforce of Power enabled him to become a mighty evil king.

2422
02:04:11,840 --> 02:04:14,500
But his dark ambitions were not satisfied.

2423
02:04:15,400 --> 02:04:17,160
Yeah, because he didn't have wisdom or courage.

2424
02:04:17,380 --> 02:04:18,580
He only had power.

2425
02:04:19,340 --> 02:04:21,260
And he had an evil heart, I guess.

2426
02:04:22,260 --> 02:04:27,380
To gain complete mastery of the world, Ganondorf started looking for those chosen by destiny.

2427
02:04:27,660 --> 02:04:29,800
So hold the other two Triforce parts.

2428
02:04:32,620 --> 02:04:35,780
The one who holds the Triforce of Courage is...

2429
02:04:35,780 --> 02:04:36,740
You, Link!

2430
02:04:37,760 --> 02:04:39,760
Fuck yeah, I was hoping it would be Courage!

2431
02:04:42,380 --> 02:04:51,240
And the other, who holds the Triforce of Wisdom, is the Seventh Sage, who is destined to be the leader of them all.

2432
02:04:59,910 --> 02:05:00,470
You?

2433
02:05:07,190 --> 02:05:08,050
No way.

2434
02:05:12,870 --> 02:05:14,690
You gotta be shitting me.

2435
02:05:16,930 --> 02:05:17,970
It is I!

2436
02:05:18,210 --> 02:05:20,130
The Princess of Hyrule, Zelda!

2437
02:05:22,870 --> 02:05:24,450
It's been you all this time?

2438
02:05:28,160 --> 02:05:29,400
Why did you do this?

2439
02:05:30,020 --> 02:05:32,140
I apologize for meeting you in disguise.

2440
02:05:32,600 --> 02:05:35,320
But it was necessary to hide from the King of Evil.

2441
02:05:35,980 --> 02:05:37,020
Please forgive me.

2442
02:05:38,760 --> 02:05:40,180
Fine, I'll forgive you.

2443
02:05:41,960 --> 02:05:43,180
You got me good, though.

2444
02:05:44,420 --> 02:05:49,060
On that day seven years ago, Ganondorf attacked Hyrule Castle.

2445
02:05:50,560 --> 02:05:51,640
That bastard.

2446
02:05:52,460 --> 02:05:55,580
I saw you as I was escaping from the castle with my attendant, Impa.

2447
02:05:58,590 --> 02:06:00,370
Man, I cannot believe that's her!

2448
02:06:03,590 --> 02:06:04,490
Oh, shit.

2449
02:06:05,350 --> 02:06:06,670
We see it from the other angle.

2450
02:06:10,790 --> 02:06:12,990
I thought I should entrust the Ocarina to you.

2451
02:06:13,810 --> 02:06:15,530
I thought that would be our best chance...

2452
02:06:15,530 --> 02:06:16,070
But wait a minute!

2453
02:06:17,810 --> 02:06:19,990
So she escaped with Impa!

2454
02:06:20,950 --> 02:06:21,890
And not Gan...

2455
02:06:21,890 --> 02:06:23,270
Oh my god!

2456
02:06:24,470 --> 02:06:31,290
As long as you had the Ocarina in your possession, I thought Ganondorf could never enter the Sacred Realm, but...

2457
02:06:32,250 --> 02:06:34,370
Something I could never expect happened.

2458
02:06:38,200 --> 02:06:43,820
After you opened the Door of Time, the Master Sword sealed you away in the Sacred Realm.

2459
02:06:46,460 --> 02:06:48,720
Your spirit remained in the Sacred Realm.

2460
02:06:49,120 --> 02:06:51,760
And then the Triforce fell into Ganondorf's hands.

2461
02:06:52,400 --> 02:06:54,540
He went on to invade the Sacred Realm.

2462
02:06:56,240 --> 02:06:58,060
Ganondorf had become the evil king.

2463
02:06:58,380 --> 02:07:00,960
And the Sacred Realm became a world of evil.

2464
02:07:01,700 --> 02:07:03,780
All of this is an unfortunate coincidence.

2465
02:07:05,040 --> 02:07:08,220
I passed myself off as a Sheikah and hoped that you would return.

2466
02:07:08,780 --> 02:07:10,620
I waited for seven years.

2467
02:07:12,920 --> 02:07:13,440
Damn!

2468
02:07:15,000 --> 02:07:16,140
Look at her earrings!

2469
02:07:18,540 --> 02:07:19,060
And?

2470
02:07:19,740 --> 02:07:20,880
Now you're back.

2471
02:07:21,540 --> 02:07:23,480
The Dark Age ruled by Ganondorf.

2472
02:07:23,600 --> 02:07:24,840
The evil king will end.

2473
02:07:27,000 --> 02:07:28,120
Hold on now, lady.

2474
02:07:28,360 --> 02:07:30,580
Let's not sell the skin before the bear is shot.

2475
02:07:31,340 --> 02:07:35,960
The six sages will open the sealed door and lure Ganondorf back into the Sacred Realm.

2476
02:07:37,180 --> 02:07:40,460
I will then seal the door to the Sacred Realm from this world.

2477
02:07:42,800 --> 02:07:45,960
Thus, Ganondorf, the evil king, will vanish from Hyrule.

2478
02:07:47,300 --> 02:07:47,820
Link!

2479
02:07:48,360 --> 02:07:51,520
In order to do this, I need your courage again.

2480
02:07:52,160 --> 02:07:54,100
Please protect me while I do my part.

2481
02:07:55,940 --> 02:07:59,540
And here is a weapon that can penetrate the evil king's defenses.

2482
02:08:00,180 --> 02:08:02,320
The power given to the Chosen Ones.

2483
02:08:03,020 --> 02:08:04,220
Let it be a machine gun.

2484
02:08:05,040 --> 02:08:06,820
The Sacred Arrow of Light!

2485
02:08:07,060 --> 02:08:09,160
With three exclamation marks!

2486
02:08:10,140 --> 02:08:10,940
Love it!

2487
02:08:11,240 --> 02:08:14,000
She's so excited about this Arrow of Light!

2488
02:08:23,900 --> 02:08:25,780
I bequeath to you...

2489
02:08:25,780 --> 02:08:27,280
The Holy AK.

2490
02:08:31,520 --> 02:08:33,860
That's a very blunt tip there, m'lady.

2491
02:08:36,580 --> 02:08:38,160
You got the light arrow!

2492
02:08:38,920 --> 02:08:41,260
Set it to sea and your arrows will be powered up.

2493
02:08:41,620 --> 02:08:44,660
The light of justice will smite evil.

2494
02:08:45,800 --> 02:08:46,640
Love that.

2495
02:08:49,140 --> 02:08:49,880
Uh-oh.

2496
02:08:53,530 --> 02:08:55,670
Looks like Ganondorf knows what's going on.

2497
02:08:56,250 --> 02:08:57,250
That rumbling.

2498
02:08:58,030 --> 02:08:59,690
It can't be...

2499
02:08:59,690 --> 02:09:00,850
It can't be what?

2500
02:09:02,310 --> 02:09:02,950
Zelda!

2501
02:09:06,230 --> 02:09:07,470
Princess Zelda.

2502
02:09:08,230 --> 02:09:09,930
You foolish traitor.

2503
02:09:11,330 --> 02:09:14,750
I commend you for avoiding my pursuit for seven long years.

2504
02:09:15,190 --> 02:09:15,830
Wow.

2505
02:09:16,190 --> 02:09:19,130
So as soon as she came out of that disguise...

2506
02:09:19,130 --> 02:09:20,910
Ganondorf was like...

2507
02:09:20,910 --> 02:09:21,390
Beep, beep, beep, beep.

2508
02:09:21,710 --> 02:09:22,430
Target acquired.

2509
02:09:22,670 --> 02:09:23,750
And he immediately knew.

2510
02:09:24,670 --> 02:09:26,070
Like the Ring of Power.

2511
02:09:28,820 --> 02:09:30,380
But you let your guard down.

2512
02:09:30,700 --> 02:09:33,580
I knew you would appear if I let this kid wander around.

2513
02:09:37,530 --> 02:09:38,290
Oh no.

2514
02:09:39,970 --> 02:09:43,990
My only mistake was to slightly underestimate the power of this kid.

2515
02:09:46,390 --> 02:09:47,570
Oh my god.

2516
02:09:49,150 --> 02:09:49,710
No!

2517
02:09:50,570 --> 02:09:52,950
It was not the kid's power I misjudged.

2518
02:09:53,210 --> 02:09:56,110
It was the power of the Triforce of Courage.

2519
02:09:57,150 --> 02:10:00,570
But with the Triforce of Wisdom that Zelda has...

2520
02:10:00,950 --> 02:10:03,110
When I obtain these two Triforces...

2521
02:10:03,950 --> 02:10:06,250
Then I will become the true...

2522
02:10:06,250 --> 02:10:07,710
RULER OF THE WORLD!

2523
02:10:11,160 --> 02:10:13,080
If you want to rescue Zelda...

2524
02:10:13,080 --> 02:10:14,440
Come to my castle.

2525
02:10:20,610 --> 02:10:21,750
Ha ha ha ha ha!

2526
02:10:23,770 --> 02:10:25,950
Bro doesn't know I have the Arrow of Light.

2527
02:10:26,830 --> 02:10:28,890
He's gonna be in for a RUDE AWAKENING!

2528
02:10:29,510 --> 02:10:31,690
Princess is in another castle, right?

2529
02:10:32,390 --> 02:10:33,610
Or something like that.

2530
02:10:34,090 --> 02:10:34,450
Is that a...

2531
02:10:34,450 --> 02:10:35,870
That's a Mario thing, isn't it?

2532
02:10:37,450 --> 02:10:39,190
I know exactly where to go.

2533
02:10:42,560 --> 02:10:43,820
That was such a...

2534
02:10:43,820 --> 02:10:45,240
A classic evil laugh.

2535
02:10:47,620 --> 02:10:49,180
Let me just slide around here.

2536
02:10:50,100 --> 02:10:51,240
I'm coming, m'lady!

2537
02:10:54,360 --> 02:10:54,880
Oh!

2538
02:10:55,260 --> 02:10:56,380
And with the boots now!

2539
02:10:57,000 --> 02:10:58,580
With the boots we can get across.

2540
02:11:00,520 --> 02:11:02,520
Oh, and let's not forget something...

2541
02:11:02,520 --> 02:11:03,200
Question mark down here.

2542
02:11:04,200 --> 02:11:04,740
Hold on, what's that?

2543
02:11:09,470 --> 02:11:10,270
Evil symbols.

2544
02:11:17,430 --> 02:11:18,510
Let's see what's going on here.

2545
02:11:20,530 --> 02:11:22,050
This is like the third time I'm here.

2546
02:11:23,590 --> 02:11:25,110
Don't you dare question mark me now.

2547
02:11:28,320 --> 02:11:29,120
You bastard.

2548
02:11:38,290 --> 02:11:39,150
Oh, wait.

2549
02:11:43,760 --> 02:11:44,460
That's sick!

2550
02:11:47,620 --> 02:11:48,660
Here we go, here we go.

2551
02:11:51,220 --> 02:11:52,340
Dispel the evil.

2552
02:11:53,520 --> 02:11:54,000
No?

2553
02:11:58,300 --> 02:11:58,780
Huh.

2554
02:12:01,260 --> 02:12:01,740
Okay.

2555
02:12:05,600 --> 02:12:06,360
Well, okay.

2556
02:12:06,520 --> 02:12:06,840
Check it out.

2557
02:12:07,000 --> 02:12:08,440
It has the moon symbol on it.

2558
02:12:09,180 --> 02:12:10,500
Let me try and play a song then.

2559
02:12:10,800 --> 02:12:12,560
I may have tried this before, but I'm gonna try it again.

2560
02:12:14,000 --> 02:12:14,600
Stay mad.

2561
02:12:15,640 --> 02:12:16,440
