02:52:36,280 --> 02:52:37,080
Hold on a minute!

3394
02:52:39,080 --> 02:52:40,780
What is going on with that fish?

3395
02:52:42,980 --> 02:52:44,220
I feel like there's a secret there.

3396
02:52:44,340 --> 02:52:45,440
You gotta hit it with a special arrow.

3397
02:52:46,240 --> 02:52:46,920
Something happens.

3398
02:52:47,080 --> 02:52:47,420
Trust me.

3399
02:52:48,200 --> 02:52:48,880
Trust me.

3400
02:52:53,520 --> 02:52:53,900
Oh!

3401
02:52:54,860 --> 02:52:56,000
I wish it wouldn't do that.

3402
02:53:02,320 --> 02:53:03,520
I thought I just drowned!

3403
02:53:03,780 --> 02:53:04,840
I accidentally hit the wrong button.

3404
02:53:08,180 --> 02:53:09,120
Don't get in combat.

3405
02:53:10,360 --> 02:53:11,020
Hey, buddy!

3406
02:53:11,180 --> 02:53:11,840
Remember me?

3407
02:53:12,000 --> 02:53:12,700
Seven years ago.

3408
02:53:12,920 --> 02:53:14,220
I played a tune for you.

3409
02:53:17,260 --> 02:53:17,700
Uh...

3410
02:53:20,060 --> 02:53:20,500
Wait.

3411
02:53:21,360 --> 02:53:24,240
Hey, aren't you the fairy buddy I met a long time ago?

3412
02:53:24,240 --> 02:53:26,040
Wow, you grew, dude!

3413
02:53:27,120 --> 02:53:28,560
Well, here's your song.

3414
02:53:28,640 --> 02:53:28,840
Yes.

3415
02:53:29,560 --> 02:53:30,040
What?

3416
02:53:31,880 --> 02:53:33,260
No, I never forget.

3417
02:53:33,620 --> 02:53:33,940
You!

3418
02:53:34,380 --> 02:53:35,620
You're the one who forgot.

3419
02:53:35,900 --> 02:53:36,560
Aren't you?

3420
02:53:37,120 --> 02:53:39,260
If you have an ocarina, play that song, baby!

3421
02:53:41,960 --> 02:53:43,280
Oh, shit.

3422
02:53:43,280 --> 02:53:43,680
Wait.

3423
02:53:46,060 --> 02:53:46,580
Oh, no.

3424
02:53:47,420 --> 02:53:47,820
Uh...

3425
02:53:50,260 --> 02:53:50,940
I got it.

3426
02:53:54,530 --> 02:53:55,330
That was it, right?

3427
02:53:58,060 --> 02:53:58,860
Oh, yeah!

3428
02:53:59,800 --> 02:54:00,380
That's it!

3429
02:54:00,480 --> 02:54:01,120
That's the tune!

3430
02:54:01,340 --> 02:54:01,900
You rock!

3431
02:54:01,920 --> 02:54:03,120
I'm blown away!

3432
02:54:04,400 --> 02:54:05,460
Oh, no, no, no, no.

3433
02:54:05,500 --> 02:54:06,320
I didn't forget the song.

3434
02:54:06,480 --> 02:54:07,560
I never forget anything.

3435
02:54:08,180 --> 02:54:09,960
But I just feel like rewarding you, baby.

3436
02:54:11,940 --> 02:54:12,880
I have a good idea.

3437
02:54:13,820 --> 02:54:17,820
My buddy Pierre is wandering around, so play that tune when you wanna call him.

3438
02:54:19,080 --> 02:54:22,140
I'll tell him to help you if he's nearby and hears that song, baby.

3439
02:54:24,140 --> 02:54:24,940
No way!

3440
02:54:26,160 --> 02:54:27,760
Did I just make a new song?

3441
02:54:32,170 --> 02:54:32,910
No way.

3442
02:54:42,460 --> 02:54:43,600
You a scammer, bro!

3443
02:54:47,670 --> 02:54:49,430
Play the usual tune to call Pierre.

3444
02:54:50,070 --> 02:54:51,990
If he's nearby, he'll come to help you, baby.

3445
02:54:52,170 --> 02:54:53,030
Okay, so he wasn't nearby?

3446
02:54:54,270 --> 02:54:54,670
Huh.

3447
02:54:57,270 --> 02:54:59,730
Okay, let me wander off a little bit over here and check.

3448
02:55:02,330 --> 02:55:02,990
All right, Pierre.

3449
02:55:03,210 --> 02:55:03,830
I call upon you.

3450
02:55:12,440 --> 02:55:13,480
That is such a scam.

3451
02:55:15,840 --> 02:55:18,100
Yo, maybe it's something I can use during a boss fight.

3452
02:55:19,020 --> 02:55:19,520
You know?

3453
02:55:19,680 --> 02:55:21,180
He will come in and just help me.

3454
02:55:22,820 --> 02:55:23,880
It's definitely like...

3455
02:55:25,380 --> 02:55:28,280
There are certain locations only you can do it, I guess.

3456
02:55:29,940 --> 02:55:31,040
Like Dark Souls, right?

3457
02:55:31,480 --> 02:55:32,120
Summoning something.

3458
02:55:32,960 --> 02:55:33,740
Well, okay.

3459
02:55:33,880 --> 02:55:35,040
We know a new song now.

3460
02:55:37,180 --> 02:55:38,240
This place is still...

3461
02:55:40,520 --> 02:55:44,720
Oh, it's blinking now because, of course, we gotta go there and do things.

3462
02:55:44,900 --> 02:55:46,620
But why is this still blinking?

3463
02:55:51,630 --> 02:55:52,110
Okay.

3464
02:55:52,850 --> 02:55:54,230
Let's call upon Epona.

3465
02:55:56,170 --> 02:55:56,650
No.

3466
02:56:05,480 --> 02:56:06,600
No, that's the...

3467
02:56:06,600 --> 02:56:06,700
No.

3468
02:56:09,460 --> 02:56:10,320
I forgot.

3469
02:56:12,000 --> 02:56:12,700
Epony me!

3470
02:56:14,520 --> 02:56:15,800
Up, left, right...

3471
02:56:15,800 --> 02:56:16,460
Oh, that's so easy.

3472
02:56:18,520 --> 02:56:19,040
Oh.

3473
02:56:19,300 --> 02:56:19,920
There it is.

3474
02:56:27,420 --> 02:56:28,280
Come to me.

3475
02:56:31,920 --> 02:56:33,120
There you are.

3476
02:56:34,140 --> 02:56:35,240
What's up, Epona?

3477
02:56:37,860 --> 02:56:38,800
Let's-a-go.

3478
02:56:43,050 --> 02:56:45,450
We are going back to Gerudo Valley.

3479
02:56:45,790 --> 02:56:49,790
Because apparently there's something there that the game really wants me to see.

3480
02:56:50,590 --> 02:56:53,010
Uh, Epona, you need to...

3481
02:56:53,010 --> 02:56:53,850
I need to jump down.

3482
02:56:54,270 --> 02:56:55,650
Have you forgotten already?

3483
02:56:56,810 --> 02:56:57,490
Come on.

3484
02:56:57,610 --> 02:56:58,270
Maximum speed.

3485
02:57:00,570 --> 02:57:01,590
There we go.

3486
02:57:03,410 --> 02:57:04,010
Epona.

3487
02:57:04,630 --> 02:57:05,670
I swear to God.

3488
02:57:06,790 --> 02:57:07,390
Yeah.

3489
02:57:07,390 --> 02:57:08,030
Okay.

3490
02:57:09,710 --> 02:57:10,410
Back we go.

3491
02:57:19,460 --> 02:57:21,380
Maybe there is a way to beat that guy in the race.

3492
02:57:21,600 --> 02:57:22,520
That's what I'm thinking right now.

3493
02:57:23,000 --> 02:57:25,060
Like, what else could it be pointing at?

3494
02:57:25,160 --> 02:57:25,940
You know, the map marker.

3495
02:57:40,370 --> 02:57:41,370
Here comes a nice song.

3496
02:57:43,230 --> 02:57:45,650
This is- Like, this song also is, like, amazing.

3497
02:57:49,490 --> 02:57:49,850
Diddling.

3498
02:57:50,410 --> 02:57:51,770
Ba-da-da-da, ba-da-da.

3499
02:57:51,910 --> 02:57:52,330
Get off!

3500
02:57:53,830 --> 02:57:54,410
There we go.

3501
02:57:56,690 --> 02:58:02,230
Okay, so- So- What am I supposed to do here, game?

3502
02:58:03,690 --> 02:58:06,410
Why is this triangle here?

3503
02:58:09,150 --> 02:58:10,390
Uh, yeah, sure.

3504
02:58:10,610 --> 02:58:10,810
Whatever.

3505
02:58:11,330 --> 02:58:11,810
Save the game.

3506
02:58:16,280 --> 02:58:16,660
You!

3507
02:58:20,810 --> 02:58:21,290
Wait.

3508
02:58:21,530 --> 02:58:22,790
It was not 1.30, though.

3509
02:58:23,370 --> 02:58:24,670
Unless they changed this.

3510
02:58:28,230 --> 02:58:31,090
No, I don't- No, no, no, I don't want to- I don't want to race you.

3511
02:58:34,440 --> 02:58:35,740
No, he's a scammer.

3512
02:58:36,760 --> 02:58:37,900
But look at the wall over there.

3513
02:58:50,540 --> 02:58:50,900
Nothing.

3514
02:58:52,280 --> 02:58:52,640
Okay.

3515
02:58:55,670 --> 02:58:56,030
You.

3516
02:58:57,430 --> 02:58:58,930
Hey, I heard you saved my men.

3517
02:58:59,770 --> 02:59:01,230
When they returned, we built- Yeah.

3518
02:59:03,310 --> 02:59:05,530
God dang, dude.

3519
02:59:09,530 --> 02:59:10,630
You like fire?

3520
02:59:13,100 --> 02:59:14,930
Oh, he ate the arrow.

3521
02:59:16,370 --> 02:59:17,130
Impressive.

3522
02:59:19,090 --> 02:59:20,670
He absorbed the energy.

3523
02:59:23,320 --> 02:59:24,300
Let's go.

3524
02:59:30,940 --> 02:59:32,800
Man, they should make a movie out of this song, too.

3525
02:59:33,480 --> 02:59:34,820
This one and the desert song.

3526
02:59:36,020 --> 02:59:37,300
Both desert songs slap.

3527
02:59:41,360 --> 02:59:43,380
Uh, where have we not been?

3528
02:59:44,700 --> 02:59:49,780
I'm still completely lost on how to get that heart here.

3529
02:59:50,000 --> 02:59:51,140
In the Haunted Wasteland.

3530
02:59:51,260 --> 02:59:52,120
Or not Haunted Wasteland.

3531
02:59:52,240 --> 02:59:55,900
In the- In the Temple of Boom.

3532
02:59:56,960 --> 02:59:57,520
You know?

3533
02:59:59,080 --> 02:59:59,700
Cypress Hill.

3534
02:59:59,840 --> 03:00:01,180
No, I forgot the name of the temple.

3535
03:00:01,300 --> 03:00:02,880
But the one with the heart on the cliff thingy.

3536
03:00:03,460 --> 03:00:04,260
On the arch.

3537
03:00:06,580 --> 03:00:09,320
I- That one is bothering me right now.

3538
03:00:13,620 --> 03:00:15,100
Maybe we gotta go there as a kid?

3539
03:00:15,820 --> 03:00:17,320
Uh, plant a flower.

3540
03:00:18,320 --> 03:00:22,220
And then that will grow, and we can fly on it and land on that arch somehow?

3541
03:00:22,240 --> 03:00:23,620
That would be another thing.

3542
03:00:23,620 --> 03:00:26,020
But I haven't seen a flower place.

3543
03:00:29,180 --> 03:00:30,980
I guess we can go back to Lost Woods.

3544
03:00:32,860 --> 03:00:34,220
It's been a while since we were there.

3545
03:00:36,480 --> 03:00:37,080
What's up, nerd?

3546
03:00:37,860 --> 03:00:39,320
Oh god, I can't turn all the way around.

3547
03:00:39,420 --> 03:00:39,540
Okay.

3548
03:00:45,290 --> 03:00:48,410
Back to the, uh, place where we began.

3549
03:00:57,600 --> 03:00:58,320
Up here.

3550
03:01:00,160 --> 03:01:02,820
You got this- Oh, what do you mean?

3551
03:01:02,860 --> 03:01:03,680
You can't jump that!

3552
03:01:04,080 --> 03:01:04,580
Epona!

3553
03:01:07,560 --> 03:01:10,160
Are you a pony or no pony?

3554
03:01:12,280 --> 03:01:16,240
Actually, maybe it is supposed to be a play on the words of pony.

3555
03:01:17,220 --> 03:01:17,660
E-pony?

3556
03:01:17,780 --> 03:01:18,400
Like I-pony?

3557
03:01:19,140 --> 03:01:24,580
Some kind of Apple device that lets you traverse vast distances in a world like this?

3558
03:01:25,620 --> 03:01:26,860
I don't- That's stupid.

3559
03:01:27,040 --> 03:01:27,960
I don't know why I said that.

3560
03:01:28,320 --> 03:01:29,360
That makes no sense.

3561
03:01:30,220 --> 03:01:31,060
Uh, get off the horse.

3562
03:01:32,940 --> 03:01:33,300
Shit!

3563
03:01:34,200 --> 03:01:34,760
There we go.

3564
03:01:40,700 --> 03:01:42,700
Oh, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

3565
03:01:42,700 --> 03:01:44,340
Oh, hold on!

3566
03:01:45,600 --> 03:01:47,760
With the boots, we can probably do this now.

3567
03:01:48,560 --> 03:01:49,860
And maybe something happens.

3568
03:01:51,560 --> 03:01:52,460
Remember those pillars?

3569
03:01:52,600 --> 03:01:53,600
We couldn't jump far enough.

3570
03:01:55,280 --> 03:01:56,780
Oh, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

3571
03:01:59,700 --> 03:02:00,560
I see a fairy.

3572
03:02:00,820 --> 03:02:01,480
We're gonna grab it.

3573
03:02:05,510 --> 03:02:06,670
Get rid of it with the bottle.

3574
03:02:07,970 --> 03:02:08,450
Oh.

3575
03:02:09,710 --> 03:02:12,670
I swore I did not try to kidnap that child just now.

3576
03:02:13,270 --> 03:02:15,190
It looked like a fairy to me.

3577
03:02:16,930 --> 03:02:17,590
Dang it.

3578
03:02:19,850 --> 03:02:21,370
Teach me some fancy fencing.

3579
03:02:21,650 --> 03:02:23,710
All I've ever done is tap B all my life.

3580
03:02:24,650 --> 03:02:26,790
Yeah, you're one of those classic B-tappers, huh?

3581
03:02:29,010 --> 03:02:29,790
Classic stuff.

3582
03:02:30,430 --> 03:02:33,310
That's why you'll never be an excellent swordsman like Link.

3583
03:02:39,500 --> 03:02:43,380
I still think you really look like somebody I've seen before, mister.

3584
03:02:45,000 --> 03:02:45,600
Yeah.

3585
03:02:46,700 --> 03:02:48,480
Hey, let's go to our home as an adult.

3586
03:02:50,760 --> 03:02:52,240
Reminisce about the good old times.

3587
03:02:55,160 --> 03:02:56,600
Look at the drawing down there.

3588
03:02:57,780 --> 03:02:58,820
I made that.

3589
03:03:03,360 --> 03:03:03,860
Oh.

3590
03:03:06,100 --> 03:03:07,040
Link's records!

3591
03:03:07,840 --> 03:03:09,420
Spider squished 48.

3592
03:03:10,380 --> 03:03:12,340
Largest fish caught 13 pounds.

3593
03:03:13,540 --> 03:03:14,820
Marathon time, 1.30.

3594
03:03:15,820 --> 03:03:17,120
Wait, something's wrong here.

3595
03:03:17,200 --> 03:03:17,760
That's not true.

3596
03:03:18,760 --> 03:03:20,260
I have records in the others.

3597
03:03:21,480 --> 03:03:22,400
Horseback archery?

3598
03:03:22,480 --> 03:03:24,000
That one I'm not sure about.

3599
03:03:25,700 --> 03:03:26,220
What?

3600
03:03:26,520 --> 03:03:27,700
That's bugged, isn't it?

3601
03:03:28,560 --> 03:03:31,080
Unless it only counts for the session you're currently playing.

3602
03:03:33,360 --> 03:03:34,000
Really confusing.

3603
03:03:39,840 --> 03:03:41,920
Because I have definitely won the horse race.

3604
03:03:45,060 --> 03:03:45,380
Hello.

3605
03:03:46,400 --> 03:03:48,500
I feel like I've known you for a long time, mister.

3606
03:03:48,640 --> 03:03:49,060
Yeah, me too.

3607
03:03:50,000 --> 03:03:50,420
You know what?

3608
03:03:50,440 --> 03:03:52,000
Let's go talk to the Deku Tree Sprout.

3609
03:03:53,920 --> 03:03:54,760
See what he has to say.

3610
03:03:54,860 --> 03:03:55,720
Maybe he's grown up.

3611
03:03:58,870 --> 03:04:00,670
Also, I'm going into Lost Woods as well.

3612
03:04:01,090 --> 03:04:02,610
Because I want to try those pillar jumps.

3613
03:04:03,950 --> 03:04:04,390
Oh.

3614
03:04:14,550 --> 03:04:15,610
You're a Hylian!

3615
03:04:15,790 --> 03:04:17,570
And we're always bound to leave this forest!

3616
03:04:18,390 --> 03:04:20,830
And now, you have learned your own destiny!

3617
03:04:21,170 --> 03:04:22,550
So you know what you must do!

3618
03:04:23,650 --> 03:04:24,310
That's right!

3619
03:04:24,590 --> 03:04:26,110
You must save the land of Hyrule!

3620
03:04:27,010 --> 03:04:27,690
Now, Link!

3621
03:04:28,050 --> 03:04:30,990
Break the curse in all the temples and return to Hyrule!

3622
03:04:33,030 --> 03:04:33,470
Motherfucker!

3623
03:04:34,270 --> 03:04:36,190
You said the same damn thing last time!

3624
03:04:36,550 --> 03:04:38,070
Also, I thought you were over here!

3625
03:04:39,150 --> 03:04:41,450
That's why I was like, Ooh, when I saw him, I thought he moved!

3626
03:04:49,060 --> 03:04:50,980
And I can't access this place anymore.

3627
03:04:52,080 --> 03:04:53,400
Oh, you know what I could try?

3628
03:04:53,480 --> 03:04:54,660
I could try to return here as a kit.

3629
03:04:54,660 --> 03:04:55,700
Maybe something happens.

3630
03:04:57,080 --> 03:04:57,840
That's an idea.

3631
03:04:59,820 --> 03:05:00,340
Hmm.

3632
03:05:08,220 --> 03:05:10,400
Wait, didn't there used to be a loading screen?

3633
03:05:10,540 --> 03:05:11,680
Between here and...

3634
03:05:11,680 --> 03:05:13,360
Maybe I'm just tripping right now.

3635
03:05:13,920 --> 03:05:16,780
Look how small this place feels when you're an adult!

3636
03:05:17,500 --> 03:05:18,740
Everything feels tiny!

3637
03:05:20,040 --> 03:05:21,000
It's really funny.

3638
03:05:25,960 --> 03:05:26,480
Hello!

3639
03:05:27,720 --> 03:05:29,700
I wonder if Saria will come back.

3640
03:05:29,780 --> 03:05:30,200
She won't.

3641
03:05:30,720 --> 03:05:31,760
She's a sage now.

3642
03:05:32,440 --> 03:05:34,060
She has important business to do.

3643
03:05:36,420 --> 03:05:38,180
She's guiding me, among other things.

3644
03:05:38,180 --> 03:05:39,900
Creating rainbow roads.

3645
03:05:41,060 --> 03:05:41,920
It's really cool.

3646
03:05:52,730 --> 03:05:54,750
I am so proficient at this game at this point.

3647
03:05:54,990 --> 03:05:58,850
When I was here in the beginning of the game, I had so much trouble just with the controls.

3648
03:06:01,170 --> 03:06:02,630
Okay, let's go into the Lost Woods.

3649
03:06:12,030 --> 03:06:12,670
Up here.

3650
03:06:27,830 --> 03:06:29,110
I love the echo sound.

3651
03:06:30,270 --> 03:06:31,130
Okay, here it is.

3652
03:06:32,170 --> 03:06:33,070
You ready for this?

3653
03:06:34,230 --> 03:06:35,470
It's my time to shine!

3654
03:06:46,560 --> 03:06:47,620
Wait, why am I doing this?

3655
03:06:49,460 --> 03:06:51,040
I can't get a head start here.

3656
03:07:04,600 --> 03:07:06,800
I don't know why I would do that, actually.

3657
03:07:08,700 --> 03:07:11,740
I can't even proceed after that.

3658
03:07:13,620 --> 03:07:14,180
Weird.

3659
03:07:15,760 --> 03:07:18,000
I probably can't fit in that hole anymore.

3660
03:07:18,300 --> 03:07:19,480
I'm too fat now.

3661
03:07:21,300 --> 03:07:22,240
What's going on in here?

3662
03:07:22,460 --> 03:07:23,160
What's up, people?

3663
03:07:23,740 --> 03:07:24,900
Got any news for me?

3664
